From: AX6 offline containment candidate
Subject: [PATCH] ipq807x: contain NSS detach without EDMA hot restore

Base: qca-nss-drv 6aa14c78e097b29c493ff2fef87e4d35906b2b5a
Prepared with source 2e207fcae4479bc55211fb83395ae2954b39b951 current
20 patches; 012/017 context-only refreshes preserve the original prepared tree.
Requires the separately frozen qca-nss-dp 009 fail-closed callback gate.

IPQ807x only: close/cancel registration outside RTNL, quarantine host DP
with RX/ACK handlers retained, join all core NAPI poll tails before IRQ
free, then clear physical RX registrations and ndpp under RTNL. Complete
NAPI ownership after a returning emergency notify, without IRQ rearm or
changes to notify/panic/firmware policy. Reject late probe/re-register and
independent sysfs bind/unbind. No firmware, EDMA ring/IRQ parameter or
hardware reinitialization changes.

This is a permanent host-only containment candidate, not general external
client/platform/module lifetime safety, general crash recovery, firmware
recovery, or live acceptance.

